250
00:10:51,952 --> 00:10:53,787
A means to an end.

251
00:10:53,853 --> 00:10:58,192
It enables a man
to build the kind of house he wants

252
00:10:58,258 --> 00:10:59,860
for a price he can afford to pay.

253
00:10:59,927 --> 00:11:00,928
-[Servo] Ow, my gout!
Oh.

254
00:11:00,995 --> 00:11:04,865
