268
00:11:33,793 --> 00:11:35,062
-Uh, that's a fish, right?

269
00:11:35,128 --> 00:11:36,730
-I sure did.

270
00:11:36,797 --> 00:11:37,865
Just last night.

271
00:11:37,932 --> 00:11:40,333
-[Servo] Whoa. I don't think I want
to hear about this.

272
00:11:41,235 --> 00:11:43,103
-[man] I'm sorry, Bill.
-[Mike] I'll have to break your legs.

273
00:11:43,170 --> 00:11:44,905
-You have to learn
to manage your money.

274
00:11:44,972 --> 00:11:47,542
