282
00:12:04,225 --> 00:12:06,560
-[Servo] Dope.
-And it's the same for you.

283
00:12:06,627 --> 00:12:08,195
-Me? Oh, no.

284
00:12:08,262 --> 00:12:10,563
That budgeting business
