287
00:12:15,837 --> 00:12:19,173
Here. This is the idea.
-[Mike] Ding!

288
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,942
-[Benjamin] A budget should fit the user.

289
00:12:21,008 --> 00:12:22,042
-Like a teddy.

290
00:12:22,108 --> 00:12:24,412
-[Benjamin] It is designed
to fit the person

291
00:12:24,478 --> 00:12:26,680
