of your friend Bob, for instance.

293
00:12:29,015 --> 00:12:30,852
-[Servo] Bob's a better
person than you are.

294
00:12:30,918 --> 00:12:33,620
-[Benjamin] He keeps a record
of each expenditure.

295
00:12:33,687 --> 00:12:34,855
-Bob is anal.

296
00:12:36,257 --> 00:12:39,927
