400
00:16:56,317 --> 00:16:58,385
-See you next week, son.

401
00:16:58,452 --> 00:16:59,720
-Here you are, son.

402
00:16:59,787 --> 00:17:02,155
-Gee, thanks, Dad.
-Thanks a lot, loser.

403
00:17:04,558 --> 00:17:05,758
